msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "마무리"

msgid ""
"Your responses help us improve our content. Please help us by taking a few minutes to provide "
"your feedback."
msgstr "여러분의 의견은 콘텐츠 개선에 도움이 됩니다. 잠시 시간을 내어 feedback을 남겨 주세요."

msgid "Share Your Feedback"
msgstr "Feedback 보내기"

msgid "Blue-capped centrifuge vials in the yellow rack used throughout the workshop."
msgstr "Workshop에서 사용한 yellow rack과 blue-cap centrifuge vial입니다."

msgid ""
"This session provides time for remaining questions, continued experimentation, and a conclusion "
"for this learning path."
msgstr "남은 질문을 논의하고 실험을 이어가며 과정을 마무리합니다."

msgid "Learning Path Summary"
msgstr "과정 돌아보기"

msgid "What You Accomplished"
msgstr "수행한 내용"

msgid "Learned why simulation matters and what the sim-to-real gap is"
msgstr "Simulation의 중요성과 Sim-to-Real gap 이해"

msgid "Built and standardized the physical lightbox workspace to match the sim task"
msgstr "Simulation task에 맞는 실물 lightbox workspace 구축·표준화"

msgid "Got hands-on time with the SO-101 robot and LeRobot tools"
msgstr "SO-101 robot과 LeRobot 도구 실습"

msgid "Applied Strategy 1: Domain randomization with teleoperation"
msgstr "전략 1: Teleoperation과 Domain Randomization 적용"

msgid "Explored NVIDIA GR00T, vision-language-action models"
msgstr "NVIDIA GR00T와 Vision-Language-Action model 탐색"

msgid "Evaluated policies in simulation and on the real robot (sim-to-real gap)"
msgstr "Simulation 및 실제 robot 평가로 Sim-to-Real gap 확인"

msgid "Applied Strategy 2: Co-training with real data, deployed to robot"
msgstr "전략 2: 실제 data와 Co-Training 후 robot 배포"

msgid "Explored Strategy 3: HG-DAgger, collecting human corrections around policy failures"
msgstr "전략 3: Policy 실패 주변의 human correction을 수집하는 HG-DAgger 탐색"

msgid "Applied Strategy 4: Cosmos synthetic data augmentation"
msgstr "전략 4: Cosmos synthetic data augmentation 탐색"

msgid ""
"Explored Strategy 5: System identification with Anchor-Lab measurements and an AnchorBench "
"actuator-profile comparison"
msgstr "전략 5: Anchor-Lab 측정과 AnchorBench actuator-profile 비교를 통한 System Identification 탐색"

msgid "The Five Strategies We Covered"
msgstr "다룬 다섯 가지 전략"

msgid "Strategy"
msgstr "전략"

msgid "Approach"
msgstr "접근 방식"

msgid "Key Benefit"
msgstr "주요 효과"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**1. Domain Randomization**"
msgstr "**1. Domain Randomization**"

msgid "Vary simulation parameters"
msgstr "Simulation parameter 변화"

msgid "Robust to configured visual and scene variation"
msgstr "설정된 visual 및 scene variation에 대한 robustness"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**2. Co-training**"
msgstr "**2. Co-training**"

msgid "Mix sim and real data"
msgstr "Simulation과 실제 data 혼합"

msgid "Better real-world distribution"
msgstr "실제 distribution을 더 잘 반영"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**3. HG-DAgger**"
msgstr "**3. HG-DAgger**"

msgid "Mix human corrections with original demonstrations"
msgstr "Human correction과 원래 demonstration 혼합"

msgid "Target the states where the policy needs help"
msgstr "Policy에 도움이 필요한 state를 집중 보완"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**4. Cosmos Augmentation**"
msgstr "**4. Cosmos Augmentation**"

msgid "Synthetic visual diversity"
msgstr "Synthetic visual diversity 생성"

msgid "Robust to visual variations"
msgstr "Visual variation에 대한 robustness"

#. Reviewed: retain original technical label, identifier, source title, or existing Korean.
msgid "**5. System Identification**"
msgstr "**5. System Identification**"

msgid "Fit simulation parameters to measured robot behavior"
msgstr "측정한 robot 동작에 맞춰 simulation parameter fitting"

msgid "More representative actuator dynamics"
msgstr "실제에 더 가까운 actuator dynamics"

msgid "Key Lessons"
msgstr "주요 교훈"

msgid "**The gap is real** — simulation success doesn't guarantee real-world success"
msgstr "**Gap은 실제로 존재합니다** — Simulation 성공이 실제 성공을 보장하지 않습니다."

msgid "**Multiple strategies combine** — no single approach solves everything"
msgstr "**여러 전략을 조합하세요** — 하나의 접근으로 모든 문제를 해결할 수 없습니다."

msgid ""
"**Measurement enables improvement** — system identification connects actuator parameters to "
"observed motion"
msgstr "**측정이 개선을 가능하게 합니다** — System Identification은 actuator parameter와 관측 motion을 연결합니다."

msgid "**Iteration is essential** — systematic improvement beats one-shot attempts"
msgstr "**반복이 중요합니다** — 한 번의 시도보다 체계적인 개선이 효과적입니다."

msgid "**Documentation matters** — recorded observations guide decisions"
msgstr "**기록이 중요합니다** — 기록한 observation이 판단의 근거가 됩니다."

msgid "How Can I Get This Code Later?"
msgstr "나중에 Code를 다시 확인하려면?"

msgid ""
"Bookmark the [public SO-101 workshop page](https://docs.nvidia.com/learning/physical-ai/sim-to-"
"real-so-101/latest/index.html) for the learning content and links to the code. This updated "
"workshop will replace the version currently published there and will be publicly available soon."
msgstr ""
"학습 자료와 code 링크가 있는 [공개 SO-101 workshop page](https://docs.nvidia.com/learning/physical-ai/sim-to-"
"real-so-101/latest/index.html)를 bookmark하세요. 이 source tag의 안내 기준으로, 갱신된 workshop은 현재 공개된 버전을 대체해 "
"곧 제공될 예정입니다."

msgid ""
"The [bill of materials](05-building-workspace.md#bill-of-materials) will be largely the same as "
"in the current public workshop. The [YouTube playlist](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list"
"=PL2bKqBZg-pzVQspO8-wieuIFctBdz_Tr_) can help you get started building your robot and workspace "
"before the update is published."
msgstr ""
"[Bill of materials](05-building-workspace.md#bill-of-materials)는 현재 공개 workshop과 대체로 같습니다. 갱신 전에 "
"robot과 workspace를 준비하려면 [YouTube playlist](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL2bKqBZg-"
"pzVQspO8-wieuIFctBdz_Tr_)를 활용하세요."

msgid ""
"For further courses, documentation, community links, and papers, see [Explore and "
"Experiment](15-explore.md#further-resources)."
msgstr "추가 과정, 문서, community 링크, paper는 [Explore and Experiment](15-explore.md#further-resources)에 있습니다."

msgid ""
"Congratulations on finishing this course **\"Train an SO-101 Robot From Sim-to-Real With NVIDIA "
"Isaac.\"**"
msgstr "**\"Train an SO-101 Robot From Sim-to-Real With NVIDIA Isaac\"** 과정을 마쳤습니다."

msgid ""
"We hope this will enable and inspire you to keep learning and practicing your skills in Physical "
"AI!"
msgstr "이 경험을 바탕으로 Physical AI 학습과 실습을 계속 이어가시기 바랍니다."

msgid "Used a prepared physical lightbox workspace matched to the simulation task"
msgstr "Simulation task에 맞춰 준비된 실물 lightbox workspace 사용"

